  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The guests are waiting for the chef. Dmitry finds Max hiding and demands a masterpiece. Let's listen closely to their exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "diana",
      "t": "Витя, просыпайтесь!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Он не проснется.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Бесполезно его будить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Максимилиан, вот вы где.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да, я здесь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Вы прячетесь от нас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я ни от кого не прячусь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Приготовьте нам маленький шедевр.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Мы хотим старинную французскую кухню.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Шеф-повару нужно отдыхать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "У нас производственное совещание.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Максимилиан, я вас жду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я сейчас к вам приду.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around Where is the Chef? line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "diana",
      "t": "Витя, просыпайтесь!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Vitya, wake up!' Diana tries to wake the Chef. She playfully tells him to get up.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Он не проснется.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He will not wake up.' Nagiyev knows it is a lost cause. He flatly states that Barinov will not wake up.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Бесполезно его будить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is useless to wake him.' He tells Diana to stop trying. Nagiyev explains that waking him is completely useless.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Максимилиан, вот вы где.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maximilian, there you are.' Nagiyev finally spots Max. He says he has been looking for him everywhere.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да, я здесь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, I am here.' Max confirms his presence. He simply states that he is here.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Вы прячетесь от нас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are hiding from us.' Nagiyev accuses Max of avoiding him. He says Max has been hiding from them.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я ни от кого не прячусь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not hiding from anyone.' Max denies the accusation. He calmly claims he is not hiding from anyone.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Приготовьте нам маленький шедевр.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Prepare a little masterpiece for us.' Nagiyev gives Max a daunting task. He orders him to prepare a little masterpiece.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Мы хотим старинную французскую кухню.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We want classic French cuisine.' He specifies the exact type of food. Nagiyev requests classic French cuisine for the guests.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Шеф-повару нужно отдыхать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A chef needs to rest.' Max tries to buy some time. He suggests the head chef needs to rest first.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "У нас производственное совещание.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have a production meeting.' Nagiyev dismisses the excuse. He insists they have a production meeting right now.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Максимилиан, я вас жду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maximilian, I am waiting for you.' Nagiyev demands Max's immediate attention. He says he is waiting for him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я сейчас к вам приду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will come to you now.' Max realizes he has no choice. He agrees to come over right away. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "diana",
      "t": "Витя, просыпайтесь!",
      "gap": 0.5
